      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PUBLICISE (3) has been solid since coming back from the Belmont Oaks, missing narrowly over 1400m in a Saturday race most recently. Back to provincial grade now is a big tick, as is the step out to 1600m again. Looks well placed on her recent form and she can return to winning ways. ROSIE CAN RUN (4) missed narrowly fresh before storming over the top to score by 0.6L at Belmont last start as the race favourite. The form out of that has already been franked and this looks to set up nicely. She's a third-up winner in the past and can repeat the dose. LATE ARRIVAL (1) was too good last start at Belmont when scoring by 0.3L over 1300m. Out to this trip now isn't an issue as he's placed in all 3 attempts at the mile. Carries the big weight but he's in good touch. TRIPLE THE CHANT (2) flew home to just miss at Belmont last time and has to be included on the back of that effort. CHANTEL (5) missed by 0.7L last start at Bunbury and won't be far away again with an inside barrier this time.",
